      "id": "macbeth/sceneIII_20.2/p@68980",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LADY MACBETH.\nNaught’s had, all’s spent,\nWhere our desire is got without content:\n’Tis safer to be that which we destroy,\nThan by destruction dwell in doubtful joy.",
